Subject: [PATCH 33/34] configs: add imx95 basic cells for FreeRTOS and Zephyr

Signed-off-by: Hou Zhiqiang <Zhiqiang.Hou@nxp.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 configs/arm64/imx95-hmc-freertos.c | 50 ++++++++++++++++++++
 configs/arm64/imx95-hmc-rtos.h     | 74 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 configs/arm64/imx95-hmc-zephyr.c   | 50 ++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 174 insertions(+)
